            <ArticleTitle>[Pain therapy for urologic cancer patients at the Potsdam district hospital--initial results].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>547-54</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>After two years the results of cancer pain treatment in urological patients at the district hospital Potsdam are presented. In 15 patients the WHO recommended three-stage analgesics plan was used successfully.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
